OL,3,GNEWSAAthletes 'jumping for joy' over
OL,4,A#2.1m stadium plans
OL,5,
OL,6,FAthletes and coaches have welcomed
OL,7,Fplans to spend almost #2.1m on repairs
OL,8,Fat an athletics stadium in Nottingham.
OL,10,FNottingham City Council's proposals for
OL,11,Fthe Harvey Hadden Stadium in Bilborough
OL,12,Fwould see the athletics track replaced,
OL,13,Fthe main stand refurbished, and
OL,14,Fimprovements made to the long jump pit
OL,15,Fand throwing cages.
OL,17,FNotts Athletics Club runners Lucy and
OL,18,FSophia, both 15, organised a
OL,19,Flong-distance relay in September to
OL,20,Fraise money for repairs.
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
