OL,3,GNEWSAAthletes 'jumping for joy' over
OL,4,A#2.1m stadium plans
OL,5,
OL,6,FLucy told the BBC she was "jumping for
OL,7,Fjoy" after hearing Nottingham City
OL,8,FCouncil planned to fund improvements,
OL,9,Fwhile Sophia said their coaches were
OL,10,F"so happy about it".
